	| 1 EXIF.IFD0.Image.ProcessingSoftware                           |
	digiKam-7.1.0 EXIF.IFD0.Image.ResolutionUnit
	| 2 EXIF.IFD0.Image.Software                                     |
	SLT-A77V v1.07                <=== EXIF.IFD0.Image.XResolution
	| 350 EXIF.IFD0.Image.YCbCrPositioning                             |
	2 EXIF.IFD0.Image.YResolution                                  | 350
	EXIF.IFD0.Time.ModifyDate                                    |
	2020:08:19 15:36:21           <=== EXIF.IFD1.Camera.Make
	| SONY                          <=== EXIF.IFD1.Camera.Model
	| SLT-A77V                      <=== EXIF.IFD1.Image.Compression
	| 6 EXIF.IFD1.Image.ImageDescription                             |
	... EXIF.IFD1.Image.Orientation                                  | 1
	EXIF.IFD1.Image.ResolutionUnit                               | 2
	EXIF.IFD1.Image.Software                                     |
	SLT-A77V v1.07                <=== EXIF.IFD1.Image.ThumbnailLength
	| 4013 EXIF.IFD1.Image.ThumbnailOffset
	| 21324 EXIF.IFD1.Image.XResolution
	| 72 EXIF.IFD1.Image.YCbCrPositioning                             |
