2019-08-28  Gilles Caulier <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* core/libs/dimg/filters/greycstoration/cimg/CImg.h,
	core/libs/dimg/filters/greycstoration/cimg/greycstoration.h,
	core/libs/dimg/filters/greycstoration/greycstorationfilter.cpp: Wrap
	old CImg header with digiKam namespace to prevent violent crash from
	new experimental GMic-Qt plugin due to more than One Definition Rule
	of CImg instance shared between digiKamcore and Gimc-Qt. digiKam as
	an very older CImg internally, and GMic-Qt a more recent one. This
	conflict is not detected at compilation time because digikamcore is
	created and shared before and the GMic-Qt plugin is compiled at a
	second stage outside digiKam.

