2018-11-11  Human Dynamo <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* core/libs/metadataengine/dmetadata/dmetadata_fileio.cpp: Second
	stage to improve stabilty of Exiv2 wrapper : 1/ NEVER use Exiv2 API
	with video or audio files. Always use ffmpeg instead. Video media
	support in Exiv2 have been never finalized... 2/ Unit-tests revelate
	that ffmpeg file parser is not very stable with image files, when
	image are corruptes and Exiv2 generate a C++ exception. In this
	case, with the previous implemention, ffmpeg was used instead, and
	ffmpeg crash with this kind of file. So only limit ffmpeg backend to
	play with video and audio files.

