	trigger automatically removes all uses of the image id in the
	ImageSimilarity table. For MySQL, there will potentially some
	changes be necessary. But those changes will only be in
	dbconfig.xml.cmake.in. Also, the ImageHaarMatrix table from CoreDB
	should be removed in a schema update.

