2017-08-10  Mario Frank <Mario.Frank@uni-potsdam.de>

	* NEWS, libs/database/utils/dbinfoiface.cpp,
	libs/database/utils/dbinfoiface.h, libs/widgets/CMakeLists.txt,
	libs/widgets/common/drangebox.cpp, libs/widgets/common/drangebox.h,
	utilities/fuzzysearch/findduplicatesview.cpp,
	utilities/fuzzysearch/findduplicatesview.h,
	utilities/fuzzysearch/fuzzysearchview.cpp,
	utilities/fuzzysearch/fuzzysearchview.h,
	utilities/maintenance/maintenancedata.cpp,
	utilities/maintenance/maintenancedata.h,
	utilities/maintenance/maintenancedlg.cpp,
	utilities/maintenance/maintenancedlg.h: Replaced the minimum and
	maximum similarity selection boxes in fuzzy search, duplicates
	search and maintenance by a new, generic DIntRangeBox which makes
	the look, feel and behavious consistent in all places. Also, this
	makes redundant code obsolete and reduces the probability of bugs.
	The new range box can be configured to an arbitrary integral minimum
	and maximum range but is per default defined for values between 0
	and 100. The range box enforces total ordering of the upper and
	lower value and also allows an arbitrary value suffix which is
	defined both for the upper and the lower value.  Also, I fixed some
	inconsistent uses of my email address in license headers.

