	* app/CMakeLists.txt: libdigikamcore: Add dependency on the
	digikam-gitversion.  digikam-version.h needs gitversion.h, which is
	generated by the digikam-gitversion target.  If the dependency is
	not specified, a parallel build can break as digikam-version.h may
	be built before gitversion.h is generated.

