	changed. This take a lot of time. This controler is also used in
	CameMessageBox to confirm which images to remove from camera. This
	message box is also restored (fdropped in same condition with 3.x
	serie) Note: This controller have been moved as well to
	ImportThumnailModel class which have been a wrong idea. This
	implementation must be separated and shared with class tht needs
	cached thumbnails. ImportThumnailModel use this controller directly
	which simplify a lots implementation. BUGS: 330063 CCMAIL:
	al.wazery@gmail.com CCMAIL: tpr@iki.fi

