2014-03-04  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/imageinfo.cpp: Reorder mutex locks - the ImageInfo
	ReadWriteLock must remain an "inner", transparent mutex. It is
	called from a place where DatabaseAccess is locked, so
	DatabaseAccess must not be locked from a place where the ImageInfo
	lock is held. To reduce by one or two mutex locks, consolidate read
	operations at one place and return the hash from a local variable
	which is in sync with the cached hash. (note: we do not rule out a
	parallel operation between the DatabaseAccess and the writing of the
	cached values. it's so far acceptable for a read cache.)  CCMAIL:
	mike@mghansen.de BUG: 331578

