2013-01-10  Andi Clemens <andi.clemens@googlemail.com>

	* libs/database/core/thumbnaildb.cpp,
	libs/database/core/thumbnaildb.h,
	utilities/maintenance/thumbsgenerator.cpp: speed up thumbnail
	generation maintenance tool.  Use a QSet for subtracting invalid
	filepaths, this is faster than using the iterator, it::erase and
	QStringList::contains. Do not extract the image id, it is never used
	and querying for it only wastes time. This will speed up the
	maintenance tool (in combination with the "scan for images without
	thumbnail" option)

