	libs/dimg/loaders/qimageloader.cpp,
	libs/dimg/loaders/rawloader.cpp, libs/dimg/loaders/tiffloader.cpp: 
	Prevent integer overflows when calculating the memory necessary for
	loading an image.  This can happen particularly for images requiring
	chunks of >4GB and when using a 32 bit variable to store width and
	height. Worst case, a smaller chunk of memory was allocated,
	resulting in a crash.  BUG: 307602 FIXED-IN: 3.0.0

