2012-09-29  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/collectionscanner.cpp,
	libs/database/imagescanner.cpp, libs/database/imagescanner.h: Split
	ImageScanner in two parts: information gathering and database
	writing.  The first part handles all disk and metadata access. The
	second part only writes compiled information to the database. This
	allows to perform the database commit in one group, which is always
	a great speed improvement for SQLite.

