	recorded. Add a container to store history and icc profile.
	Undo/redo now works cleanly when a plugin changes the color profile.
	DMetadata is currently not kept in undo because either an
	imageplugin (only two atm, noncritical) or a concurrent user
	metadata editing operation can change the metadata; essentially, all
	critical metadata editing would need to be applied before saving. In
	ImageWindow, we re-write from the database to metadata before
	saving, so probably all will work.  BUG: 303163

