	PGF codec. Report this settings in Help/Components Info dialog. This
	option is disabled by default. Paralelized PGF encoding give
	sometime corrupted thumbnail data stored in DB when it run through
	QThread. Note : running paralelized PGF thumb encoding in main
	thread with QtPGFTest program always give a valid PGF image.

