2012-02-01  Matthias Welwarsky <matze@welwarsky.de>

	* imageplugins/color/adjustlevelstool.cpp: Fix: levels tool settings
	not correctly restored for 16bit images  The tool saves its settings
	in 8bit scale, which causes loss of precision when 16bit image
	levels are divided down on save and scaled up on restore. The fix is
	to always save settings in 16bit scale and scale down only when an
	8bit image is loaded.  Signed-off-by: Matthias Welwarsky
	<matze@welwarsky.de>

