2012-03-06  Gilles Caulier <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* digikam/CMakeLists.txt, kioslave/CMakeLists.txt: Remove digiKam
	kio-slave dependencies with digikamcore shared library. By this
	commit, we limit external shared lib influence to kio-slave. For ex,
	why we need to link kio-slave with Marble shared lib which is linked
	to digikamcore and can break binary compatibility when user update
	external packages. This commit link digiKam kio-slave only with
	digikamdatabase. This will limit shared libs to load at kio-slave
	start, which can be faster and prevent time-out under MACOSX and
