2012-03-03  Andi Clemens <andi.clemens@googlemail.com>

	* digikam/main/digikamapp.cpp: Fix maintenance action  The
	maintenance action will always be disabled if the maintenace tool
	has no options set and the user clicks "OK". The "signalComplete"
	will fire before the action is disabled in the "slotMaintenance()"
	method, therefore the action will be enabled first by
	"slotMaintenanceDone()" and than disabled by "slotMaintenance()"...


