2012-01-20  Gilles Caulier <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* NEWS: update bugreport closed in NEWS file. Ananta, usually, we
	list all bugzilla files closed for a release. We use it to write
	release announcement. By files closed, we includes : - FIXED (by
	commits, or old entries fixed previously, but not checked by users
	at the right time) - INVALID (if the information from report,
	typically the thread, can be interresting for end users) - WONTFIX
	(if arguments are important for end users, to give visibility to the
	project)  We don't included UNMAINTENED, DOWNSTREAM, UPSTREAM,
	DUPLICATE, WAITFORINFO, etc...  CCMAIL: anantapalani@gmail.com

