	* CMakeLists.txt, libs/threads/parallelworkers.cpp,
	libs/threads/parallelworkers.h: Add a support class to hold a group
	of WorkerObjects to work in parallel  ParallelAdapter is a template
	class wrapped around the WorkerObject-derived class which
	implemented the slots for work in a thread. All signals directed to
	the slots of the ParallelAdapter instance will be distributed to all
	attached workers.

