2012-01-06  Gilles Caulier <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* utilities/cameragui/controller/cameracontroller.cpp,
	utilities/cameragui/controller/cameracontroller.h,
	utilities/cameragui/controller/downloadsettings.h,
	utilities/cameragui/main/cameraui.cpp: bugfix : introduce a download
	settings list to group all items to download using a common data
	container, and call just one time camera controler to start items
	transfert from device to computer. In old implementation, the loop
	used to pass items list to download on camera controler, pass one by
	one all items, and after set download progress bar. This is weird,
	because download process can start before to pass all items (if list
	is huge), especially on fast computers. In this case, we can see a
	pop up notification on KDE status bar saying than all download are
	complete just at start-up.

