2011-11-13  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* digikam/album/albumwatch.cpp, digikam/album/albumwatch.h,
	libs/3rdparty/kinotify/kinotify.cpp,
	libs/3rdparty/kinotify/kinotify.h: Add movedFrom and movedTo signals
	to prevent missing file change information  The KInotify::move
	signal is only emitted if both source and target are being watched.
	As we only watch the digikam collections, we miss anything moved
	from or to the outside, including moving to the trash. Instead,
	listen to the movedFrom and movedTo signals which are emitted
	without such preconditions

