	* libs/database/imageinfo.cpp, libs/database/imageinfolist.cpp,
	libs/database/imageinfolist.h, libs/models/imagefiltermodel.cpp: Use
	batch load methods for tags and group image.  These fields are not
	loaded by the ioslave, but in the Preparer (and then used for
	filtering). Using batch calls is clearly visible in profiling (17%
	vs. 0.01% in a given profiling situation spent in the preparer)

