2011-09-10  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/databaseparameters.cpp: Fix thumbnail database with
	SQLite  For the last few days, the main database would be used as
	thumbnail database. The reason is that the backend always read the
	main fields of the DatabaseParameters, now prefixed "img". For
	starting the thumbnail database, the thumbnailParameters() method is
	used to retrieve a DatabaseParameters object with the "tmb"
	parameters copied to the main fields. This method was a no-op.  The
	API is not that elegant now but at least it works.

