2011-08-21  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* digikam/main/digikamapp.cpp: Enable deferred scanning of files
	This means when you add a larger number of new files "offline" while
	digikam is not running, when starting digikam, it will not wait
	until all files are scanned, but files are scanned in a thread while
	the main process is continuing to start. Initial test successful,
	needs more testing (and prove that it really works)  CCMAIL:
	digikam-devel@kde.org

