2011-08-20  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/imageinfo.cpp, libs/database/imagelister.cpp,
	libs/database/imagelisterrecord.h: Make file sizes >2GB work with
	SQlite without changing ioslave protocol  To avoid changing the
	protocol, any 31bit-value will be passed from the ioslave, any
	larger value will be reread from the main application. For large
	file size support in MySQL, a schema change is needed.  CCBUG:
	276920

