	* utilities/cameragui/main/cameraui.cpp,
	utilities/cameragui/main/cameraui_p.h, utilities/setup/setup.cpp,
	utilities/setup/setup.h, utilities/setup/setupcamera.cpp,
	utilities/setup/setupcamera.h: digiKam Camera Interface: to speed-up
	downloading from camera device, a new settings have been implemented
	to configure a default target album for downloading from camera. If
	this option is turned off, digiKam will ask where you want to
	download items. If this option is turned on, nothing will be ask to
