2011-06-28  Francesco Riosa <francesco+kde@pnpitalia.it>

	* data/database/dbconfig.xml.cmake,
	libs/database/databasecopymanager.cpp: Migrate_Cleanup_DB was out of
	sync  Migrate_Cleanup_DB was managing drop of the tables during
	migration, but it was lacking some tables, thus migrating over an
	existing (and populated) db had undefined behaviour. The drop is now
	managed directly by DatabaseCopyManager::copyDatabases, where it's
	guaranteed that copied tables are deleted before.

