	* digikam/metadatahub.cpp: Ignore internal tags in MetadataHub As
	color labels are tags, the tag part of the hub would always re-add
	any previously added color label tag (after the color label part
	removed it). If multiple color label tags are present, the highest
	tag id wins, which created the impression that you could not change
	to a "lower" color.  CCBUG: 152424

