2010-12-13  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/imagehistory/imagehistorygraphmodel.cpp,
	libs/database/imagehistory/imagehistorygraphmodel.h: First thorough
	implementation. Provides three modes: 1) a flat list. Images are
	sorted by depth first search,    in which edges are accessed
	modification date time order 2) a simple tree. Same order as above,
	but with added depth. 3) A combined view with FilterActions
	available. Uses longestPath    to get a main path. After the current
	item is reached on the path,    all leaf images (current versions)
	are listed flat,    with intermediates below a subitem (currently
	effectively hidden)   svn
	path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/core/; revision=1206225

