	tests/filteractiontestimages/DSC00636_v5.png: Add a test for
	reproducible actions. Add test images for the "auto" filters (test
	is passed for those).  To prepare a test case: - we have defined an
	original image, which is supplied - in digikam, load the original
	and apply one or several filters - store as a new version, as PNG
	for lossless(!) compression - commit the file to the test images
	directory  The test does the following: - load the original image -
	for each remaining image in the directory:    - load the image    -
	read the history, extract the applied filter actions    - apply the
	actions to the original image using a FilterActionFilter    -
	compare pixel-by-pixel the new result to the stored result    - fail
	if not identical  If filters are changed and older versions are not
	supported, simply a new testcase should be produced, replacing the
	old one (even better if the filter still supports the old version)
