2010-11-02  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/imagehistory/imagehistorygraphmodel.cpp,
	libs/database/imagehistory/imagehistorygraphmodel.h: New class
	ImageHistoryGraphModel. This model takes an ImageHistoryGraph and
	will be able to present the graph in different modes. Currently
	basically implemented is a "main path tree" where a main path
	through original and current is present top-level and all relations
	as children.  Internally, a shallow internal tree is constructed on
	the heap, other approaches become increasingly complex, difficult
	and bug-prone. Because of lazyness, an ImageModel is used to
	implement data() for entries referring to an ImageInfo.  Not in use,
	under development.   svn path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/;
	revision=1192348

