	* digikam/digikamimagefacedelegate.cpp, libs/dimg/dimg.cpp,
	libs/threadimageio/thumbnailcreator.cpp: - Do not adjust the rect
	for face thumbnail display in the delegate, but only immediately
	before   the cropping is done. Why? There are problems with rotated
	images and unknown sizes from the database.   During the creation
	process, the correct, rotated size is definitely known. - When
	rotating a DImg, also adjust the original size. This may defy the
	meaning of "original size",   but otherwise it's difficult to get
	the correct scaling ratio of the reduced preview,   which is the
