2010-08-16  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* digikam/albummanager.cpp, digikam/albummanager.h,
	libs/models/abstractalbummodel.cpp,
	libs/models/albumfiltermodel.cpp, libs/models/albumfiltermodel.h: 
	Finally I found out why filtering by tag property didn't work.  When
	a new album is added or an existing is changed,
	setDynamicSortFilter() will update the filtering for this index; but
	in our filtering approach, which also displays children and parents
	of matches, a change may effect the filtering of other indexes as
	well. So we need to listen for changes and completely
	invalidateFilter() then.  Implement that with the help of a new
	signal in AlbumManager.   svn
	path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=1164239

