	* digikam/digikam.notifyrc,
	libs/dimg/filters/bw/bwsepiasettings.cpp, showfoto/showfoto.cpp,
	utilities/imageeditor/editor/editorwindow.h,
	utilities/imageeditor/editor/imagewindow.cpp,
	utilities/imageeditor/widgets/previewlist.cpp,
	utilities/queuemanager/basetools/color/bwconvert.cpp: - B&W
	converter for BQM : Add preview using default image preview from
	Oxygen. Fix crash due to a non initialized pointer. Please, always
	set a pointer to zero : in GDB, you will see an use of null pointer
	which is wrong of course. An unitialized pointer as a dumy which is
	impossible to identify as wrong quickly... - Add a new kde notifier
	event when editor as saved a file. This is usefull when you review
	RAW files in icon view and you edit item in editor. During a save
	operation, which can take a while, you can go back to icon view to
