	, utilities/advancedrename/parser/modifiers/removedoublesmodifier.h: 
	New modifier: "Remove Doubles"  This modifier will delete duplicate
	words from an renaming option. At least my camera produces some
	duplicate words when using the camera name option:  [cam]  => "Nikon
	Nikon D50"  With the modifier you can remove those duplicate words:
	[cam]{removedoubles}  => "Nikon D50"  In the future this modifier
	can take parameters, like - remove only words that follow
