2010-07-29  Martin Klapetek <martin.klapetek@gmail.com>

	* libs/imageproperties/imagepropertiesversionsdelegate.cpp,
	libs/imageproperties/imagepropertiesversionsdelegate.h,
	libs/imageproperties/imagepropertiesversionstab.cpp,
	libs/models/imageversionsmodel.cpp,
	libs/models/imageversionsmodel.h: Image versions sidebar polish. Now
	it incorporates the WorkingWidget when waiting for thumbnail to get
	loaded. The widget is part of the delegate and its timer is
	connected with the model, which emits dataChanged() on timer
	timeout, which causes the view to repaint (and to acutally animate
	the widget). This has one more advantage - the thumbnails get
	displayed immediately once they're loaded. The timer is then
	disconnected after all thumbs are loaded, otherwise to prevent
	unnecessery (and useless) view repaints. Also thumbs are now
	centered inside the given rect and in case that thumbnail fails to
	load (pixmap is null), an error icon (task-reject) is displayed
	instead.  svn path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/;
	revision=1156573

