	* databaseserver/databaseserver.cpp: SVN_SILENT build  Putting a ","
	between the strings will make it separate arguments, and i18n()
	complains. Either use preprocessor concatenation (as in this
	commit), or use i18n()+i18n() etc. (the latter being dangerous, as
	it can easily lead to untranslatable "i18n puzzles").  CCMAIL:
	hamsi2k@freenet.de  svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/;
