	* NEWS, utilities/imageeditor/editor/editortoolsettings.cpp: As some
	tools need more space than vertically available in settings widget
	they get a vertical scollbar. The vertical scrollbar instantly
	introduces a horizontal scrollbar as the widget content do not fit
	into space any more. This patch adds the height of a scrollbar to
	minimumSizeHint()'s width so there is always enough width to display
	widget content and scrollbar.  BUGS: 211814 CCBUGS: 211524, 221989
	svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=1081612

