2009-10-03  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* NEWS, libs/dimg/filters/dimgrefocus.cpp,
	libs/dimg/filters/dimgrefocus.h: Interesting crash: Destruction is
	done in the order class destructor -> member destructors -> base
	class destructor. DImgRefocus has a DImg as a member. The thread is
	stopped in the parent class's destructor. If the thread is running
	and accessing the member, the member is destructed before the thread
	is stopped -> crash.  BUG: 207330  svn
	path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=1030978

