	* NEWS, libs/dimg/loaders/jpegloader.cpp: Fix subtle bug in the JPEG
	loader that broke scanning images: jpeg_finish_decompress was moved
	from the data loading code down below reading the ICC profile, which
	was broken previously because the decompressing had already been
	closed. When image data is not loaded (as for scanning), calling
	jpeg_finish_decompress without calling jpeg_start_decompress before
	resulted in an error, which meant the loader returned false before
	setting width and height.  BUG: 206071  svn
