	* libs/dimg/filters/iccprofile.cpp, libs/dimg/filters/iccprofile.h: 
	IccProfile is a new class encapsulating an ICC profile, either from
	memory or from a file on disk. It's a Qt style API, implicitly
	shared, passed around by value and hides the implementation details.
	(It's a bit late in the beta process for a major API overhaul but
	there are enough color management bugs anyway, and it was no fun
	fixing bugs with a lot of code duplication)  svn
