	* utilities/fuzzysearch/findduplicatesview.cpp: Add a threshold
	spinbox to the find duplicates search. The default threshold value
	is not enough sometimes, 87% might be too high in some cases and
	duplicate (or very similar) images are not found. With the spinbox,
