2009-03-14  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/database/imageinfo.h: Declare ImageInfo as a movable type.
	This makes using it in a QList more efficient: It's a shared
	datatype with the sizeof a pointer anyway, like QString. By telling
	this Qt can store the object directly in QList's pointer array
	instead of allocating a new ImageInfo() for every entry. See
	http://doc.trolltech.com/qq/qq19-containers.html  svn
	path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/0.11/; revision=939444

