	* libs/widgets/common/dcursortracker.h: In the libraries, use
	Q_SIGNALS: and Q_SLOTS: instead of signals: and slots: They are
	syntactically equivalent and should be used to avoid conflicts with
	boost signals, and with python's use of "slots" in its headers.  svn
	path=/branches/extragear/graphics/digikam/0.11/; revision=932654

