	change.  In old Cmake implementation, there is a conflict between
	libdigikam shared lib and digikam bin program to define set of
	target names. the script dedicated to run digikam (named
	digikam_bin) do not run because it try to play with digikam_bin
	binary file, which doesn't exist (only digikam file exist of course)
	This fix rename libdigikam to libdigikamcore to remove this
	dysfunction.  NOTE: you need to clean up all and recompile. Let's me
	hear is all is fine for you.  CCMAIL: digikam-devel@kde.org   svn
