	* digikam/albumwidgetstack.cpp, libs/widgets/common/thumbbar.cpp: 
	fix centering of the selected image in filmstrip  this commit will
	fix the centering of the currently selected image in album icon view
	as well as in image editor. Strangely showFoto isn't working,
	although it is derived from the same class as image editor.  There
	is still a problem on first init: sometimes the width of the content
