	* libs/threadimageio/loadingcache.cpp,
	libs/threadimageio/loadingcache.h: Calculate cache cost of thumbnail
	cache based on used memory, not simply  the number of cached
	thumbnails. This means for thumbnails of size 64 there will be 16
	times more (*) thumbnails cached than for size 256.  (*) For
	QPixmaps, memory usage is not directly accessible. I use size and
	depth and calculate the max cost based on the display's default
	depth.  CCBUG: 166564  svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/;
