	digiKam from trunk (KDE4) : Camera GUI : new option to capture a
	picture from camera.  Only Gphoto2 camera drivers (PTP include) can
	support this feature. Of course, your camera must be able to support
	capture mode. A new dialog will display in live the lens preview
	from camera. When you want to take the picture, just press "Capture"
	button. A new picture file will be recorded on camera media
	following camera settings.  This tool can be usefull if you perform
	nature or astro digital photography.  A screenshot of the new Camera
	Capture tool in action is given at this url:
	http://digikam3rdparty.free.fr/Screenshots/digikamKDE4_06.png
