	* libs/threadimageio/thumbnailloadthread.cpp,
	libs/threadimageio/thumbnailloadthread.h,
	libs/threadimageio/thumbnailtask.cpp,
	libs/threadimageio/thumbnailtask.h: Add the initial version of a
	multithread thumbnail loading. These classes have the functionality
	to replace the digikamthumbnail ioslave, the ThumbnailJob and the
	PixmapManager classes. They share the infrastructure of the
	threadimageio library we are using for loading full images and
	previews. It is the hope that the removed cost of moving the image
	data through the shared memory segment from the ioslave will make
	thumbnail loading slightly faster.  The code is not yet used or
	tested in digikam.  CCMAIL: digikam-devel@kde.org  svn
	path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=696764

