	* libs/dimg/dshareddata.h: Add a pair of classes to implement our
	style of sharing data, the good old "explicit caching" with some
	extra methods for my special needs.  Large parts of the code are
	taken from qshareddata.h (hence the slightly different copyright
	header - GPL v2 only) This code uses QAtomic methods, but it is from
	a _public header_ which means that the API used there - even if not
	officially documented - will not be subject to change (to keep BC).
	The class still needs to be tested - it only compiles.  svn
	path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=678618

