2007-05-21  Gilles Caulier <caulier.gilles@gmail.com>

	* utilities/lighttable/lighttablepreview.cpp: digiKam from trunk :
	Light Table preview : fix tile side effect with high zoom level.
	This is a first approach how to solv ethis problem. It's not optimum
	but work fine.  What the problem exactly ? Well it's simple : we
	scaling a part of full image to render a preview unsing a tile
	matrix. The part of ful image is scaled with take a care of image
	data outside the region. With a high zoom level the scale algorithm
	cannot compute properlly the border of the tile and a side effect
	appear.  CCBUGS: 145198  svn
	path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=667096

