2007-05-12  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/widgets/common/previewwidget.cpp: Adapt the line step of the
	scroll bars to the zoom factor. For low zoom factors, scrolling with
	the mouse wheel is still precise, for higher zoom rates the steps
	get bigger. This means the approx. the same amount of mouse wheel
	scrolling is required for to scroll the same span in the original
	picture, regardless of zoom rate.  For the overall relative speed, I
	added a factor of 2 which feels good, please report if scrolling
	steps are too big or too small.  (bug 145237, #4)  CCBUG: 145237
	svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=663883

