2007-05-08  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* digikam/imagepreviewview.cpp,
	utilities/lighttable/lighttablepreview.cpp: Fix problem that cached
	preview image is null. In Qt3, QImage is using explicit sharing.
	This means any operation on the actual data of the QImage object
	will modify the data of all objects, in this case, including the
	cached image.  This is indeed unintuitive, and the  Trolls have
	changed it so that in Qt4 QImage is also implicitly shared. So this
	fix should be enough for now.  CCMAIL: caulier.gilles@gmail.com  svn
	path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=662659

