	libs/threadimageio/loadsavetask.h,
	libs/threadimageio/loadsavethread.cpp,
	libs/threadimageio/loadsavethread.h: Add a hack to prevent a
	deadlock at application shutdown when the app is closed while a raw
	image is being loaded in the histogram side bar.  The KProcess-based
	raw loader is waiting for the dcraw process to finish, but the main
	thread is wait()ing for the thread to finish, and no KProcess events
	are delivered. This hack can be removed when we port to Qt4 and use
	the synchronous QProcess.   svn
