	interface.  - Separate Preview and Edit of picture. Preview is
	embedded into main interface, Edit is dedicaced to image editor. -
	digiKam album content area can be now toogled between the current
	image collection thumbs or the current preview of image selected in
	collection - To toogle between these views press F3. You can also
