2006-02-21  Marcel Wiesweg <marcel.wiesweg@gmx.de>

	* libs/dimg/filters/bcgmodifier.cpp: digikam from trunk: rounding
	error of BCG modifier  With the current algorithm, even setting a
	gamma of 1.0 would create changes, (x / 255.0) * 255.0 might be
	slightly less than x, so casting this value to int would result in
	an error of 1. I hope using the round() function is a correct fix
	for this, at least the 1.0 value now creates a proper x=y mapping.
	svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/; revision=512021

