	* digikam/iconitem.cpp, digikam/iconitem.h: subtle bug. iconitem
	used update instead of repaint, this would cause the repaints to be
	not immediate and as a result an iconitem might still be marked as
	dirty even though a thumbnail has been generated for it. so when
	pixmapmanager asked for next item for thumbnailing, the same item
	was returned again. but there is already a pixmap for it in the
	cache and so the thumbnailing process stopped. thanks to tom for
	reporting this.  svn path=/trunk/extragear/graphics/digikam/;
	revision=436086

