	* utilities/imageeditor/imagepluginloader.cpp,
	utilities/imageeditor/imagepluginloader.h: plugin->name() is the
	QObject name() function and we don't have any control over it (the
	name is set internally by klibloader). So we need to hold the name
	of the service separately. instead of adding a function to the
	imageplugin base which will break BC, hold the names of the service
