2005-04-30  Tom Albers <toma@kde.org>

	* digikam/albumpropsedit.cpp: While porting this function to the
	experimental branch, I ran into this bug in the logica. When you are
	young, you make stupid mistakes. Calculation of the average date in
	an album is based on the difference in days to the first image. When
	calculating the average date of an album, you can not use abs(),
	because that will ignore a negative difference.  svn
	path=/trunk/kdeextragear-3/digikam/; revision=408787

