2005-04-23  Adriaan de Groot <groot@kde.org>

	* Makefile.am: [Damn -m automatism] Anyway, this is adding the
	beginning of Doxygen support for digikam. The things to remember
	are:  1) The Makefile.am must include the Doxy bla-bla 2) Each file
	to document must have a /** @file Foo */ header 3) You _must_
	document a surrounding { file, namespace, class }    for the
	documentation of inner things (ie. member functions)    to be
	visible, so document everything.  svn
	path=/trunk/kdeextragear-3/digikam/; revision=407419

