	* imageplugins/filmgrain/imageeffect_filmgrain.cpp,
	imageplugins/filmgrain/imageeffect_filmgrain.h: digiKam image editor
	plugin Film Grain : new film grain generator implementation based on
	GimpGuru.org tutorial (http://www.gimpguru.org/Tutorials/FilmGrain)
	: - Create grain mask with neutral gray - Bluring grain mask. -
	Apply curve correction for middle tone only. - Merging original
	image with grain mask.  The results are very nice. ISO sensibilty is
	now limited to 6400 instead 3200.  CCMAIL:
