	utilities/imageeditor/undoaction.h,
	utilities/imageeditor/undocache.cpp,
	utilities/imageeditor/undocache.h,
	utilities/imageeditor/undomanager.cpp,
	utilities/imageeditor/undomanager.h: Undo for digiKam image-editor.
	The undo-stack design is very simple: actions are either reversible
	(rotate,flip) or irreversible (rest of the actions and all of the
	plugin actions). The reversible undos are implemented by just saving
	the commands and for the irreversible undos image copies are saved
	into a temporary database.  At some later stage, this will be
	improved and redos & "History based undo-redo" will be implemented
	BUG: 87105  svn path=/trunk/kdeextragear-3/digikam/; revision=386811


