	of loading the cached thumbnail using qimage, a native png loader
	is loader with significant speed improvements in thumbnail loading
	(approx 5x) * the Digikam namespace has been dropped from
	ThumbnailJob class, as it was   a remnant of the 0.6.x series  *
	please test for any regressions * the gdbm preload thumbnail hack
