2004-07-26  Renchi Raju <renchi.raju@kdemail.net>

	* digikam/albumiconview.cpp: when the native thumbnail loader fails
	and kde previewjob is used, the previewjob returns the thumbnail
	with fileitem. if the file got deleted in the meantime or the album
	got changed, digikam will crash as the kfileitem has been deleted
	and we are referencing a deleted item. solution: use kurl causing
	previewjob to generate its own kfileitem and on return use the url
	to find the item in the dictionary to assign the pixmap.  svn
	path=/trunk/kdeextragear-3/digikam/; revision=333018

